<title>BELGIUM: Commission nuclear report delayed.</title>
<headline>Commission nuclear report delayed.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission's indicative nuclear programme to be published under article 40 of the Euratom treaty will be presented on September 25, and not this Wednesday as originally planned, an EU source said on Monday.</p>
<p>There was no special reason for the delay of the communication, which will describe the current situation of the sector and outline some ideas about its future development.</p>
</text>
